Alembic migrations for the engine database.

Generate a new revision with the venv alembic and a reviewer-friendly message:

    .venv/Scripts/python.exe -m alembic revision --autogenerate -m "what changed"

Apply everything (the app does this on startup too):

    .venv/Scripts/python.exe -m alembic upgrade head

The database URL comes from the engine settings; set ULASAPP_DATABASE_URL to target another file.
